msgid "The VSCF programs (VSCF)"
msgstr "VSCF 程序 (VSCF)"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下\\ *选项*\\ 可用："

msgid ""
"``VAM=5`` truncates the series after the 2D term. In almost all cases "
"``VAM=2`` is fully sufficient. Vibrational angular momentum terms are "
"accounted for in a perturbational manner and do not affect the wavefunction."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=5`` 在 2D 项之后截断该级数。在几乎所有情况下，\\ ``VAM=2`` 是完全足够的。振动角动量项以微扰方式处理，不影响波函数。"

msgid ""
"The following input example for a polynomial based calculation of anharmonic"
" frequencies and intensities at the ``VSCF`` level (1) optimizes the "
"geometry of water, (2) computes the harmonic frequencies,(3) generates a "
"potential energy surface around the equilibrium structure, (4) transforms "
"the grid points to polynomials and (5) computes the nuclear wave function "
"and the infrared intensities at the ``VSCF`` level. Vibrational angular "
"momentum terms (``VAM``) are included. Note, that it is recommended to "
"perform a ``VCI`` calculation after a ``VSCF`` calculation. The details of "
"the ``VCI`` input are described in the next chapter `the VCI program (VCI) "
"<vibration_correlation_programs.html#the-vci-program-vci>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下是一个基于多项式计算 ``VSCF`` 级别非谐频率和强度的输入示例：(1) 优化水的几何结构，(2) 计算谐波频率，(3) "
"在平衡结构周围生成势能面，(4) 将网格点转换为多项式，以及 (5) 在 ``VSCF`` 级别计算核波函数和红外强度。振动角动量项（\\ "
"``VAM``\\ ）被包含在内。请注意，建议在 ``VSCF`` 计算之后执行 ``VCI`` 计算。\\ ``VCI`` 输入的详细信息在下一章 "
"`the VCI program (VCI) <vibration_correlation_programs.html#the-vci-program-"
"vci>`__ 中描述。"

msgid "Internal Coordinates"
msgstr "内坐标"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "Record handling"
msgstr "记录处理"

msgid ""
"The ``DISK`` directive allows to specify explicitly, from where the "
"potential information shall be taken and where it shall be stored to disk. "
"This can also be accomplished in an automated manner. These features are "
"only relevant for the simulation of vibronic spectra as one has to deal with"
" several PESs in the same input. For simple VCI calculations, no information"
" is needed here."
msgstr ""
"``DISK`` "
"指令允许明确指定从何处获取势能信息以及将其存储到磁盘的何处。这也可以通过自动方式完成。这些功能仅与模拟振动光谱相关，因为需要在同一输入中处理多个势能面。对于简单的"
" VCI 计算，此处不需要任何信息。"

msgid "The VIBSTATE program (VIBSTATE)"
msgstr "VIBSTATE 程序 (VIBSTATE)"

msgid ""
"The ``VIBSTATE`` program allows to specify the vibrational states to be "
"calculated in the following vibrational SCF and vibration correlation "
"programs. Within the input stream, the ``VIBSTATE`` program needs to be "
"called prior to the first call of the VSCF program. By default, the "
"fundamental modes of the molecule are calculated only. In order to define "
"the list of states to be calculated, the following keywords are available:"
msgstr ""
"``VIBSTATE`` 程序允许指定在后续的振动 SCF 和振动关联程序中要计算的振动态。在输入流中，\\ ``VIBSTATE`` "
"程序需要在首次调用 VSCF 程序之前被调用。默认情况下，仅计算分子的基频模式。为了定义要计算的状态列表，可以使用以下关键词："

msgid "Definition of vibrational states"
msgstr "振动态的定义"

msgid "Exclusion of vibrational states"
msgstr "振动态的排除"

msgid "``VSCF,options [vscf]``"
msgstr "``VSCF,options [vscf]``"

msgid ""
"The ``VSCF`` program is exclusively based on the Watson Hamiltonian "
"\\begin{align} \\hat{H} = \\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{\\alpha\\beta} ( "
"\\hat{J}_\\alpha - \\hat{\\pi}_\\alpha) \\mu_{\\alpha\\beta} "
"(\\hat{J}_\\beta - \\hat{\\pi}_\\beta) -\\frac{1}{8}\\sum_\\alpha "
"\\mu_{\\alpha\\alpha} -\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_i \\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial "
"q_i^2}  + V(q_1,\\dots,q_{3N-6}) \\label{eq:1} \\end{align} in which the "
"potential energy surfaces, :math:`V(q_1,\\dots,q_{3N-6})`, are provided by "
"the ``XSURF`` module. The Watson correction term and the 0th order term of "
"the vibrational angular momentum terms are by default (``VAM=2``) included. "
"As VSCF calculations are extremely fast, these calculations cannot be "
"restarted. For details see:"
msgstr ""
"``VSCF`` 程序完全基于 Watson 哈密顿量 \\begin{align} \\hat{H} = \\frac{1}{2} "
"\\sum_{\\alpha\\beta} ( \\hat{J}_\\alpha - \\hat{\\pi}_\\alpha) "
"\\mu_{\\alpha\\beta} (\\hat{J}_\\beta - \\hat{\\pi}_\\beta) "
"-\\frac{1}{8}\\sum_\\alpha \\mu_{\\alpha\\alpha} -\\frac{1}{2}\\sum_i "
"\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial q_i^2}  + V(q_1,\\dots,q_{3N-6}) \\label{eq:1}"
" \\end{align} 其中势能面 :math:`V(q_1,\\dots,q_{3N-6})` 由 ``XSURF`` 模块提供。Watson "
"校正项以及振动角动量项的零阶项默认（\\ ``VAM=2``\\ ）包含在内。由于 VSCF 计算速度极快，这些计算无法重新启动。详情参见："

msgid ""
"J. Meisner, P.P. Hallmen, J. Kästner, G. Rauhut, *Vibrational analysis of "
"methyl cation - rare gas atom complexes: CH:math:`_3^+`-Rg (Rg=He, Ne, Ar, "
"Kr)*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5084100>`__ **150**, "
"084306 (2019). G. Rauhut, T. Hrenar, *A Combined Variational and "
"Perturbational Study on the Vibrational Spectrum of P:math:`_2`F:math:`_4`*,"
" Chem. Phys. **346**, 160 (2008)."
msgstr ""
"J. Meisner, P.P. Hallmen, J. Kästner, G. Rauhut, *Vibrational analysis of "
"methyl cation - rare gas atom complexes: CH:math:`_3^+`-Rg (Rg=He, Ne, Ar, "
"Kr)*, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5084100>`__ **150**, "
"084306 (2019). G. Rauhut, T. Hrenar, *A Combined Variational and "
"Perturbational Study on the Vibrational Spectrum of P:math:`_2`F:math:`_4`*,"
" Chem. Phys. **346**, 160 (2008)."

msgid ""
"**``AVERAGE``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) By default state-specific VSCF "
"calculations will be performed. ``AVERAGE=1`` allows for configuration "
"averaged VSCF calculations, i.e. CAVSCF. The averaging will be performed for"
" those states being defined by the ``VIBSTATE`` program (see below). The "
"vibrational ground state will always be excluded. An identical weight factor"
" will be used for all states, i.e. the inverse of the number of states."
msgstr ""
"**``AVERAGE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =0）默认执行态特定的 VSCF 计算。\\ ``AVERAGE=1`` "
"允许进行构型平均的 VSCF 计算，即 CAVSCF。平均将针对由 ``VIBSTATE`` "
"程序定义的那些态进行（见下文）。振动基态将始终被排除。所有态将使用相同的权重因子，即态数目的倒数。"

msgid ""
"**``BASIS``\\ =\\ *variable*** ``BASIS=DGB`` (default) defines a mode-"
"specific basis of distributed Gaussians and distributes the Gaussians in a "
"way, that the overlap integral between two functions is always the same "
"(controlled by ``THRBASOVLP``). This guarantees that an increasing number of"
" basis functions will always lead to an improvement. ``BASIS=HO`` defines a "
"harmonic oscillator basis. Using this basis together with ``MAXITER=0`` and "
"``VAM=0`` provides a simple harmonic oscillator basis to be used in all "
"subsequent programs, e.g. in the VCI program."
msgstr ""
"**``BASIS``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** ``BASIS=DGB``\\ "
"（默认）定义基于分布高斯函数的模式特定基组，并以两个函数之间的重叠积分始终相同（由 ``THRBASOVLP`` "
"控制）的方式分布高斯函数。这保证了基函数数目的增加总会带来改进。\\ ``BASIS=HO`` 定义谐振子基组。将此基组与 ``MAXITER=0`` "
"和 ``VAM=0`` 一起使用可提供一个简单的谐振子基组，用于所有后续程序，例如 VCI 程序。"

msgid ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *n*** ``INFO=1`` provides a list of the values of all "
"relevant program parameters (options)."
msgstr "**``INFO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``INFO=1`` 提供所有相关程序参数（选项）值的列表。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXITER``\\ =\\ *n*** (=999 default) This key sets the maximum number of"
" iterations to be performed in the VSCF program."
msgstr "**``MAXITER``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =999）此关键字设置 VSCF 程序中执行的最大迭代次数。"

msgid ""
"**``MUPLOT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) plots all :math:`\\mu`-tensor surfaces"
" up to *n*\\ D and a corresponding Gnuplot script in a separate subdirectory"
" (``plots``). This option works only in combination with ``POT=POLY``. The "
"``VAM`` option has to be set accordingly, i.e. you must at least use "
"``VAM=4``."
msgstr ""
"**``MUPLOT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =0）将所有最高至 *\\ n*\\ 维的 :math:`\\mu` 张量面以及相应的 "
"Gnuplot 脚本绘制到单独的子目录（\\ ``plots``\\ ）中。此选项仅在与 ``POT=POLY`` 结合时有效。必须相应地设置 "
"``VAM`` 选项，即至少使用 ``VAM=4``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NBAS``\\ =\\ *n*** The number of basis functions (distributed Gaussians "
"or harmonic oscillator functions) to be used for solving the VSCF equations "
"can be controlled by ``NBAS``\\ =\\ *n*. The default is ``NBAS=18`` for a "
"basis of distributed Gaussians, while its is ``NBAS=16`` for a harmonic "
"oscillator basis. This option is only active once an analytical "
"representation of the potential has been chosen, see the option ``POT`` and "
"the ``POLY`` program."
msgstr ""
"**``NBAS``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 用于求解 VSCF 方程的基函数（分布高斯函数或谐振子函数）数目可通过 ``NBAS``\\ =\\"
" *\\ n* 控制。对于分布高斯基组，默认值为 ``NBAS=18``\\ ，而对于谐振子基组则为 ``NBAS=16``\\ "
"。此选项仅在选择了势的解析表示后才有效，参见选项 ``POT`` 和 ``POLY`` 程序。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** (=3 default) The expansion order of the potential in "
"the ``VSCF`` calculation can differ from the expansion order in the "
"``XSURF`` calculation. However, only values less or equal to the one used in"
" the surface calculation can be used."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =3）\\ ``VSCF`` 计算中势的展开阶数可与 ``XSURF`` "
"计算中的展开阶数不同。然而，只能使用小于或等于曲面计算中所用阶数的值。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of "
"the dipole surfaces shall be truncated. The default is set to 3. Note that "
"``NDIMDIP`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 截断偶极矩曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开的项。默认设置为 3。请注意 "
"``NDIMDIP`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of "
"the polarizability tensor surfaces are truncated. The default is set to 0. "
"Note that ``NDIMPOL`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 截断极化率张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开的项。默认设置为 0。请注意 "
"``NDIMPOL`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *n*** Term after which the :math:`n`-body expansions of"
" the quadrupole tensor surfaces are truncated. The default is set to 0. Note"
" that ``NDIMQUAD`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 截断四极矩张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开的项。默认设置为 0。请注意 "
"``NDIMQUAD`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``ORTHO``\\ =\\ *n*** Determines the type of orthogonalization within the "
"VSCF program. ``ORTHO=1`` invokes a symmetrical orthogonalization, "
"``ORTHO=2`` a canonical one and ``ORTHO=3`` uses a canonical one together "
"with an elimination of linear dependencies (see also keyword ``THRLINDEP``. "
"The default is ``ORTHO=1``."
msgstr ""
"**``ORTHO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 确定 VSCF 程序中的正交化类型。\\ ``ORTHO=1`` 调用对称正交化，\\ "
"``ORTHO=2`` 调用典型正交化，\\ ``ORTHO=3`` 使用典型正交化并结合消除线性依赖（另见关键字 ``THRLINDEP``\\ "
"）。默认值为 ``ORTHO=1``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``POT``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=\\ ``GRID`` default) VSCF solutions can be "
"obtained using a potential in grid representation, i.e. ``POT=GRID``, or in "
"an analytical representation, ``POT=POLY``, ``POT=BSPLINE``, ``POT=GAUSS``. "
"In the latter cases the ``POLY`` program needs to be called prior to the "
"``VSCF`` program in order to transform the potential."
msgstr ""
"**``POT``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** （默认 =\\ ``GRID``\\ ）VSCF 解可通过网格表示中的势获得，即 "
"``POT=GRID``\\ ，或解析表示，\\ ``POT=POLY``\\ 、\\ ``POT=BSPLINE``\\ 、\\ "
"``POT=GAUSS``\\ 。在后几种情况下，需要在 ``VSCF`` 程序之前调用 ``POLY`` 程序以转换势。"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) This option provides an extended "
"output. ``PRINT=1`` prints the vibrationally averaged rotational constants "
"for all computed states and the associated vibration-rotation constants "
":math:`\\alpha`. Moreover, the temperature dependence of bond lengths will "
"also be printed, when the potential is represented by a linear combination "
"of basis functions. ``PRINT=2`` prints the effective 1D polynomials in case "
"that the potential is represented in terms of polynomials, see the option "
"``POT=POLY`` and the ``POLY`` program. In addition the generalized VSCF "
"property integrals, i.e. :math:`\\left < VSCF \\left | q_i^r \\right | VSCF "
"\\right >` are printed. These integrals allow for the calculation of "
"arbitrary vibrationally averaged properties once the property surfaces are "
"available. Default: ``PRINT=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =0）此选项提供扩展输出。\\ ``PRINT=1`` "
"打印所有计算态的振动平均转动常数以及相关的振转常数 :math:`\\alpha`\\ "
"。此外，当势由基函数的线性组合表示时，还将打印键长的温度依赖性。\\ ``PRINT=2`` 在势以多项式表示时打印有效的一维多项式，参见选项 "
"``POT=POLY`` 和 ``POLY`` 程序。此外还打印广义 VSCF 性质积分，即 :math:`\\left < VSCF \\left |"
" q_i^r \\right | VSCF \\right >`\\ 。一旦性质曲面可用，这些积分允许计算任意振动平均性质。默认：\\ "
"``PRINT=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"/\\*  \\* **``SADDLE``\\ =\\ *n*** By default, i.e. ``SADDLE=0``, the "
"``VSCF`` program assumes, that the reference point of the potential belongs "
"to a local minimum. Once the PES calculation has been started from a "
"transition state, this information must be provided to the ``VSCF`` program "
"by using ``SADDLE=1``. Currently, the ``VSCF`` program can only handle "
"symmetrical double-minimum potentials. \\*/"
msgstr ""
"/\\*  \\* **``SADDLE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 默认情况下，即 ``SADDLE=0``，``VSCF`` "
"程序假定势的参考点属于局部极小值。一旦从过渡态开始进行 PES 计算，必须通过使用 ``SADDLE=1`` 将此信息提供给 ``VSCF`` "
"程序。目前，``VSCF`` 程序只能处理对称双极小值势。 \\*/"

msgid ""
"**``SOLVER``\\ =\\ *n*** For solving the one-dimensional Schrödinger "
"equation within a grid representation two different algorithms can be used. "
"The default, i.e. ``SOLVER=1``, calls the discrete variable representation "
"(DVR) as proposed by Hamilton and Light. Alternatively, the collocation "
"algorithm of Young and Peet can be used (``SOLVER=2``)."
msgstr ""
"**``SOLVER``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 对于在网格表示中求解一维薛定谔方程，可使用两种不同的算法。默认值，即 "
"``SOLVER=1``\\ ，调用由 Hamilton 和 Light 提出的离散变量表示（DVR）。或者，可以使用 Young 和 Peet "
"的配置算法（\\ ``SOLVER=2``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``THERMO``\\ =\\ *n*** ``THERMO=1`` allows for the improved calculation of"
" thermodynamical quantities (compare the ``THERMO`` keyword in combination "
"with a harmonic frequency calculation). However, the approach used here is "
"an approximation: While the harmonic approximation is still retained in the "
"equation for the partition functions, the actual values of the frequencies "
"entering into these functions are the anharmonic values derived from the "
"``VSCF`` calculation. Default: ``THERMO=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``THERMO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``THERMO=1`` 允许改进热力学量的计算（与谐频计算结合时比较 ``THERMO`` "
"关键字）。然而，此处使用的方法是一种近似：虽然配分函数方程中仍保留谐波近似，但进入这些函数的频率实际值是由 ``VSCF`` "
"计算得到的非谐值。默认：\\ ``THERMO=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``THRBASOVLP``\\ =\\ *value*** Overlap between two Gaussian basis "
"functions, once ``BASIS=DGB`` has been chosen. The default is 0.75."
msgstr ""
"**``THRBASOVLP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 一旦选择了 ``BASIS=DGB``\\ ，两个高斯基函数之间的重叠。默认值为"
" 0.75。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLINDEP``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold for eliminating linear "
"dependencies in the VSCF procedure (see keyword ``BASIS=DGB``). The default "
"is ``THRLINDEP=1e-8``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRLINDEP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 在 VSCF 过程中消除线性依赖的阈值（见关键字 ``BASIS=DGB``\\ "
"）。默认值为 ``THRLINDEP=1e-8``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``VAM``\\ =\\ *n*** The 0D terms of the vibrational angular momentum "
"terms, i.e. :math:`\\frac{1}{2} \\sum_{\\alpha\\beta} "
"\\hat{\\pi}_\\alpha\\mu_{\\alpha\\beta} \\hat{\\pi}_\\beta`, and the Watson "
"correction term are by default (``VAM=2``) included."
msgstr ""
"**``VAM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 振动角动量项的零维项，即 :math:`\\frac{1}{2} "
"\\sum_{\\alpha\\beta} \\hat{\\pi}_\\alpha\\mu_{\\alpha\\beta} "
"\\hat{\\pi}_\\beta`\\ ，以及 Watson 校正项默认（\\ ``VAM=2``\\ ）包含在内。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=1`` adds the Watson correction term (see Eq. \\eqref{eq:1}) as a "
"pseudo-potential like contribution to the fine grid of the potential (grid "
"version only). Once an analytical representation of the potential is used, "
"the consideration of the Watson correction term is controlled in the "
"``POLY`` program."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=1`` 将 Watson 校正项（参见式 "
"\\eqref{eq:1}）作为类赝势贡献添加到势的细网格中（仅限网格版本）。一旦使用势的解析表示，Watson 校正项的考虑由 ``POLY`` "
"程序控制。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=2`` accounts for the 0th order terms of an n-mode expansion of the "
":math:`\\mu`-tensor within the VSCF iterations."
msgstr "``VAM=2`` 在 VSCF 迭代中考虑 :math:`\\mu` 张量的 n 模式展开的零阶项。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=3`` does not include any VAM terms in the VSCF iterations, but instead"
" accounts for them in the VMP1 energy correction."
msgstr "``VAM=3`` 在 VSCF 迭代中不包含任何 VAM 项，而是在 VMP1 能量校正中考虑它们。"

msgid ""
"``VAM=4`` truncates the expansion of the effective moment of inertia tensor "
"after the 1D terms (rather than the 0D term in case of ``VAM=2`` or "
"``VAM=3``). These terms are only included in the VMP1 energy correction. "
"Note that values higher than 2 are only active for non-linear molecules."
msgstr ""
"``VAM=4`` 在 1D 项之后截断有效惯性矩张量的展开（而不是在 ``VAM=2`` 或 ``VAM=3`` 情况下的 0D 项）。这些项仅包含在"
" VMP1 能量校正中。请注意，大于 2 的值仅对非线性分子有效。"

msgid ""
"**``WFPRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) This key allows for the printing of "
"the effective potentials and of the *n* lowest modals. The corresponding "
"gnuplot files will be dumped into the directory plotwf."
msgstr ""
"**``WFPRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =0）此关键字允许打印有效势和最低的 *\\ n* 个模态。相应的 gnuplot "
"文件将转储到目录 plotwf 中。"

msgid "<!--"
msgstr "<!--"

msgid ""
"!ONLY IN BETA!!!!!!! It is not advisable to use it that way, it is only the "
"first draft(Also the code :D )!!! ``INTC,options`` The ``INTC`` directive "
"allows the VSCF/VCI calculation in internal coordinates."
msgstr ""
"！仅限 BETA 版！！！！！！！不建议以这种方式使用，这仅是初稿（代码也是 :D ）！！！\\ ``INTC,options`` ``INTC`` "
"指令允许在内坐标中进行 VSCF/VCI 计算。"

msgid ""
"**``DIAGVSCF``\\ =\\ *n*''** If :math:`n=1` (Default), only the diagonal "
"G-Matrix will be used in the VSCF calculation"
msgstr "**``DIAGVSCF``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** 若 :math:`n=1`\\ （默认），在 VSCF 计算中仅使用 G 矩阵的对角元"

msgid ""
"**``TDIAG``\\ =\\ *n*''** :math:`n` equals the dimension of the multimode "
"expansion of the diagonal elements of the G-matrix"
msgstr "**``TDIAG``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** :math:`n` 等于 G 矩阵对角元的多模展开的维数"

msgid ""
"**``TOFFDIAG``\\ =\\ *n*''** :math:`n` equals the dimension of the multimode"
" expansion of the off-diagonal elements of the G-matrix"
msgstr "**``TOFFDIAG``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** :math:`n` 等于 G 矩阵非对角元多模展开的维数"

msgid ""
"**``DERIVG``\\ =\\ *n*''** :math:`n` equals the dimension of the multimode "
"expansion of the derivative of the G-matrix"
msgstr "**``DERIVG``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** :math:`n` 等于 G 矩阵导数多模展开的维数"

msgid ""
"**``PSEUDOPOT``\\ =\\ *n*''** :math:`n` equals the dimension of the "
"multimode expansion of the pseudopotential"
msgstr "**``PSEUDOPOT``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** :math:`n` 等于赝势多模展开的维数"

msgid ""
"**``LEVEX``\\ =\\ *n*\\ ``**, **``\\ CITYPE\\ ``=//n//``**, **``CIMAX``\\ "
"=\\ *n*''** compare to VCI, Cleanup necessary"
msgstr ""
"**``LEVEX``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *\\ ``**, **``\\ CITYPE\\ ``=//n//``**, "
"**``CIMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** 与 VCI 比较，需要清理"

msgid ""
"**``EIGVAL``\\ =\\ *n*''** only computes the :math:`n` lowest eigenvalues of"
" the VCI matrix, default is 20."
msgstr "**``EIGVAL``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** 仅计算 VCI 矩阵的 :math:`n` 个最低本征值，默认值为 20。"

msgid ""
"**``SYM``\\ =\\ *n*''** :math:`n=0`: No symmetry at all, :math:`n=1`: Sorts "
"according to symmetry in VCI-Matrix and prints the full matrix (DEBUGGING, "
"Only when all coordinates are symmetric), :math:`n=2`: uses symmetry "
"blocking of the VCI matrix (Only when all coordinates are symmetric)"
msgstr ""
"**``SYM``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** :math:`n=0`\\ ：完全不用对称性；\\ :math:`n=1`\\ ：在 VCI"
" 矩阵中按对称性排序并打印完整矩阵（调试用，仅当所有坐标均对称时）；\\ :math:`n=2`\\ ：使用 VCI "
"矩阵的对称性分块（仅当所有坐标均对称时）"

msgid ""
"**``CONT``\\ =\\ *n*''** If :math:`n=0`, no VCI calculation will be done, "
"with :math:`n=1`\\ (Default) a VCI calculation is done."
msgstr ""
"**``CONT``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *''** 若 :math:`n=0`\\ ，则不进行 VCI 计算；当 :math:`n=1`\\ "
"（默认值）时进行 VCI 计算。"

msgid "-->"
msgstr "-->"

msgid "``DISK,options``"
msgstr "``DISK,options``"

msgid ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n*** Rather than using the options ``START`` and ``SAVE`` "
"one may simply assign a label *n* to a certain PES and all the records will "
"be set automatically."
msgstr ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 无需使用 ``START`` 和 ``SAVE`` 选项，只需为某个 PES 指定标签 *\\ "
"n*，所有记录都将被自动设置。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *record*** This specifies the record, where to dump the "
"VSCF information. Usually this is the same record as specified in the "
"``START`` option. Note that the VSCF information is currently stored in the "
"same record as the polynomial information."
msgstr ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定用于转储 VSCF 信息的记录。通常该记录与 ``START`` "
"选项中指定的记录相同。注意，VSCF 信息目前与多项式信息存储在同一个记录中。"

msgid ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *record*** Polynomial and other information shall be read "
"from the specified record. This must be the same record, to which the "
"polynomials have been dumped in the ``POLY`` program."
msgstr ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 从指定记录读取多项式及其他信息。该记录必须与 ``POLY`` "
"程序中转储多项式所用的记录相同。"

msgid "``VIBSTATE,options``"
msgstr "``VIBSTATE,options``"

msgid ""
"**``COMBI``\\ =\\ *n*** Choosing ``COMBI``\\ =\\ *n* allows for the "
"calculation of the vibrational overtones and combination bands. The value of"
" :math:`n` controls the excitation level, i.e. the number of states to be "
"computed increases very rapidly for large values of *n*. Therefore, by "
"default the upper limit is set to 5000 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`, but this cutoff "
"can be changed by the option ``UBOUND``. Note that, ``COMBI=1`` and "
"``COMBI=2`` generate the same vibrational states."
msgstr ""
"**``COMBI``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 选择 ``COMBI``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ * "
"可以计算振动泛频和组合带。:math:`n` 的值控制激发能级，即随着 *\\ n* 增大，需要计算的状态数会非常迅速地增加。因此，默认上限设为 "
"5000 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ ，但可通过选项 ``UBOUND`` 更改此截断值。注意，\\ ``COMBI=1`` 和 "
"``COMBI=2`` 生成相同的振动态。"

msgid ""
"**``UBOUND``\\ =\\ *value*** The upper energy limit for the generated states"
" is controlled by the keyword ``UBOUND``, i.e. states, for which the "
"harmonic estimate is larger than *value*, will not be computed. The default "
"is set to 5000 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`."
msgstr ""
"**``UBOUND``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 生成状态的能量上限由关键字 ``UBOUND`` 控制，即谐波估计值大于 *\\ "
"value* 的状态将不被计算。默认值设为 5000 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``LQUANT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) If the molecule of interest belongs to"
" a non-Abelian point group, real linear combinations of complex basis "
"functions can be used as startvectors for the VCI calculation by setting "
"``LQUANT=1``. For symmetric top molecules the default is ``LQUANT=1`` and "
"``LQUANT=0`` for asymmetric top molecules.  By using this option, also the "
"mapping between real and complex coordinates will be given in the output."
msgstr ""
"**``LQUANT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 =0）若所研究的分子属于非阿贝尔点群，可通过设置 ``LQUANT=1`` "
"使用复基函数的实线性组合作为 VCI 计算的起始向量。对于对称陀螺分子，默认为 ``LQUANT=1``\\ ；对于非对称陀螺分子，默认为 "
"``LQUANT=0``\\ 。使用此选项时，输出中还会给出实坐标与复坐标之间的映射。"

msgid ""
"**``VSTATEONLY``\\ = *n*** (=0 default) Once additional vibrational states "
"have been defined by using the ``VSTATE`` directive, the VSCF program can be"
" forced to compute just these states by the option ``VSTATEONLY=1``. Note "
"that the vibrational ground state will always be computed and needs not to "
"be specified explicitly."
msgstr ""
"**``VSTATEONLY``\\ = *\\ n*** （默认 =0）一旦通过 ``VSTATE`` 指令定义了额外的振动态，可通过选项 "
"``VSTATEONLY=1`` 强制 VSCF 程序仅计算这些状态。注意，振动基态将始终被计算，无需显式指定。"

msgid ""
"**``IRREP``\\ =\\ *string*** By setting ``IRREP``\\ =\\ *string*, only "
"states defined by the keywords ``COMBI``, ``UBOUND``, ``LQUANT`` and "
"userdefined states via the ``VSTATE`` directive with the chosen irreducible "
"representation (irrep) are calculated. Depending on the point group of the "
"molecule, the following irreps are available: A, A`, A``, A1, A1`, A1``, A2,"
" A2`, A2``, Ag, A1g, A2g, Au, A1u, A2u, B, B1, B2, B3, Bg, B1g, B2g, B3g, "
"Bu, B1u, B2u, B3u, E, E`, E``, E1, E1`, E1``, E2, E2`, E2``, Eg, E1g, E2g, "
"Eu, E1u, E2u, T, T1, T2, Tg, T1g, T2g, Tu, T1u, T2u."
msgstr ""
"**``IRREP``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** 通过设置 ``IRREP``\\ =\\ *\\ string*，仅计算由关键字 "
"``COMBI``\\ 、\\ ``UBOUND``\\ 、\\ ``LQUANT`` 以及通过 ``VSTATE`` "
"指令用户定义的状态中具有所选不可约表示（irrep）的状态。根据分子的点群，可用的不可约表示如下：A、A`、A``、A1、A1`、A1``、A2、A2`、A2``、Ag、A1g、A2g、Au、A1u、A2u、B、B1、B2、B3、Bg、B1g、B2g、B3g、Bu、B1u、B2u、B3u、E、E`、E``、E1、E1`、E1``、E2、E2`、E2``、Eg、E1g、E2g、Eu、E1u、E2u、T、T1、T2、Tg、T1g、T2g、Tu、T1u、T2u。"

msgid "``VSTATE,options``"
msgstr "``VSTATE,options``"

msgid ""
"By this directive, userdefined vibrational states can be defined. It "
"specifies the occupation number vector of the vibrational state to be "
"calculated. If only those vibrational states shall be computed, which are "
"defined by the ``VSTATE``, ``VSTATEONLY=1`` in the ``VIBSTATE`` program has "
"to be set."
msgstr ""
"通过此指令，可以定义用户指定的振动态。它指定待计算振动态的占据数向量。若仅希望计算由 ``VSTATE`` 定义的那些振动态，则必须在 "
"``VIBSTATE`` 程序中设置 ``VSTATEONLY=1``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``MODE(n)``\\ =\\ *m*** The :math:`n`\\ th mode of the molecule is "
"supposed to have the quantum number *m*. If several modes are excited, the "
"option can be repeated accordingly, e.g. "
"``VSTATE,MODE(1)=3,MODE(3)=2,MODE(6)=2``. All other modes are not excited "
"and thus have the quantum number 0."
msgstr ""
"**``MODE(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ m*** 假定分子的第 :math:`n`\\ 个模式具有量子数 *\\ "
"m*。若激发多个模式，可相应地重复该选项，例如 ``VSTATE,MODE(1)=3,MODE(3)=2,MODE(6)=2``\\ "
"。所有其他模式均不被激发，因此量子数为 0。"

msgid ""
"**``LQUANT(n)``\\ =\\ *m*** For symmetric top and linear molecules the "
"specification of the quantum number :math:`l` is supported by the keyword "
"``LQUANT``. With ``LQUANT(n)=l`` the :math:`n`\\ th mode is supposed to have"
" the quantum number :math:`l` corresponding to the angular momentum. The "
"occupation number must be set by the keyword ``MODE(n)``. E.g., "
"``VSTATE,MODE(3)=2,LQUANT(3)=2``. All :math:`l`-quantum numbers not set will"
" have a value of zero. Note that this option can only be used for degenerate"
" mode pairs. The counting of modes in this context belongs to the complex "
"representation."
msgstr ""
"**``LQUANT(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ m*** 对于对称陀螺分子和线性分子，关键字 ``LQUANT`` 支持指定量子数 "
":math:`l`\\ 。通过 ``LQUANT(n)=l``\\ ，假定第 :math:`n`\\ 个模式具有对应于角动量的量子数 "
":math:`l`\\ 。占据数必须通过关键字 ``MODE(n)`` 设置。例如，\\ "
"``VSTATE,MODE(3)=2,LQUANT(3)=2``\\ 。所有未设置的 :math:`l` "
"量子数均取值为零。注意，此选项仅可用于简并模式对。在此上下文中，模式的计数属于复表示。"

msgid ""
"``EXCLUDE,options\\\\`` By this directive, user defined vibrational states "
"can be excluded from the generated list of states. The state to be skipped "
"is defined via ``MODE`` as described in the context of the directive "
"``VSTATE``."
msgstr ""
"``EXCLUDE,options\\\\`` 通过此指令，可以将用户指定的振动态从生成的状态列表中排除。待跳过的状态通过 ``MODE`` "
"定义，方式如 ``VSTATE`` 指令所述。"
